========================================
IMPORTANT NOTE ON "BEST MODEL" CRITERIA
========================================
The training script saves "best" based on val_loss, not accuracy metrics.
While epochs 11-15 show better abs_rel and a1, their loss is slightly higher.
This is why epoch 10 was initially "best", but now epochs 14 and 15 are saved
as they achieved lower validation loss (0.5397 and 0.5395 respectively).

Consider modifying the script to save based on abs_rel or a1 instead of loss
for more meaningful "best" checkpoints.

